# This is a file of tests for the GMOS sequencer in a suitable format to be read
# by the tcsTests.tk procedure.
# 
# This particular file is aimed at checking the input ranges to the commands
# that control the tracking of the atmospheric dispersion corrector and
# detector translation assembly. 
#
# Comments are introduced by a # in the first column
# Blank lines can be left if required.
# The currently allowed keywords are (case is immaterial)
#
#  Test   <testId>
#  Command <commandName>
#  Field   <CAD field> <value>
#  Response Accept | Reject
#  Timeout <msecs>
#  OnError Continue | Abort
#  Log     <recordName>
#  Directive Start | Preset

# This first part before the first Test keyword can be used to setup 
# global values for Response, TimeOut and OnError. These global values
# can be over ridden within specific tests

Response Reject
TimeOut  30000
OnError  Continue

Help
Help This test file checks the trapping of invalid input to the atmTrack
Help command.
Help
Help The first tests check for null input. If the commands in question have
Help been run at any time after booting and prior to running these tests then
Help there will already be input on the CAD fields and so these null tests
Help will fail. To validate the trapping of null input you will have to
Help reboot the GMOS sequencer and start these tests again.
Help
Help Press continue when ready
Help

# Tests start here. Each test must start with the Test keyword, end with
# a Directive keyword and have at least one Command keyword. Any Field
# keywords are assumed to apply to the last command

Test UT00010
Summary Check rejection of null input to tracking mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  DIR MARK   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00020
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to tracking mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  XXXXX   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00030
Summary Check rejection of null input to entrance prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00040
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to entrance prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  xxxxx
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00050
Summary Check rejection of out of range input entrance prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  -361.0 
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00060
Summary Check rejection of out of range input entrance prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  361.0 
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00070
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to exit prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  10.0 
  Field  C  xxxxx
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00080
Summary Check rejection of out of range input to exit prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  10.0 
  Field  C  -361.0 
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00090
Summary Check rejection of out of range input to exit prism angle in MOVE mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  MOVE   
  Field  B  10.0 
  Field  C  361.0 
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00100
Summary Check rejection of null input to minimum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00110
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to minimum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  xxxxx
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00120
Summary Check rejection of too small a minimum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  1.0 
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00130
Summary Check rejection of too large a minimum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  3000.0
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00140
Summary Check rejection of null input to maximum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  500.0
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00150
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to maximum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  500.0
  Field  E  xxxxx
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00160
Summary Check rejection of too small a maximum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  500.0
  Field  E  1.0
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00170
Summary Check rejection of too large a maximum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  0.4 
  Field  E  3000.0
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT00180
Summary Check rejection of maximum < minimum wavelength in FOLLOW  mode 

 Command atmTrack 
  Field  A  FOLLOW   
  Field  D  500.0
  Field  E  480.0
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

# Test UT00190
# Summary Check that rejection by Components Controller is reported correctly
